# Hidden Doors production redirects
# Import this inside the hidden-doors.ru site block before the static file handler.

redir /hiddendoors /hidden-doors/ 301
redir /hiddendoors/ /hidden-doors/ 301

# Canonical host redirects should live in the main Caddy config:
# http://hidden-doors.ru  -> https://hidden-doors.ru
# https://www.hidden-doors.ru -> https://hidden-doors.ru
